      "name": "Impact",
      "field": "about",
      "value": "IMPACT is a Central Florida drum and bugle corps that debuted in 2012 at the Drum Corps Associates World Championships and joined DCI SoundSport in 2016. The group operates year-round, performing at conventions, parades, high school band shows, and other engagements with members ranging from teens to older adults."
