    {
      "sourceKey": "zephyrus-drum-bugle-corps",
      "targetKey": "0010a00001irt8maat",
      "name": "Zephyrus",
      "field": "about",
      "value": "Formed in 2018, Zephyrus Arts Institute is an Oklahoma-based nonprofit organization devoted to providing life-changing experiences to performers and audiences alike. The organization includes the Zephyrus Drum & Bugle Corps, the Zephyrus Independent Winter Guard, the Zephyrus Marching Academy, and the Tulsa Winds Community Band. A DCI SoundSport ensemble between 2022 and 2024, Zephyrus is currently recognized as an Open Class Affiliate, in the second year of a three-year evaluation process."
    },
