      "sourceKey": "northern-lights-drum-bugle-corps",
      "targetKey": "northern-lights",
      "name": "Northern Lights",
      "field": "about",
      "value": "Marking its inaugural season in 2023, Northern Lights achieved a Gold rating at the SoundSport International Music & Food Festival as part of DCI World Championships Week in Indianapolis. The corps' mission is to provide an affordable and accessible marching arts experience to all those who seek it in the Midwest. In the corps' second year of a three-year evaluation process, Northern Lights is currently recognized as an All-Age Class Affiliate."
